{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoScoring"}],"title":"GnustoScoring","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"GnustoScoring"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A game’s "},{"code":"maxScore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is a literal, read at bootstrap before a single rule has run,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so on its own it is the author’s arithmetic and nothing else. Add a sixth award"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and forget the total, and the game ships with a ceiling the player walks straight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"past. This library makes the award table the one place a register’s points are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written, and hands the total to the bootstrap, which compares it against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"maxScore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and warns when the two disagree."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"code":"GameContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle rather than a "},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", because it owns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"saved state: two sets of register names — the awards already paid, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"treasures currently sitting in the trophy case. Both are "},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"namespace under "},{"code":"Scoring","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and ride along in save files. That makes the wiring two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"steps rather than one. List the instance in the game’s "},{"code":"content","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" block, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"splice its rule factories into the game’s own "},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything the rules operate on is the host’s. The host declares the treasures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and puts a "},{"code":".takeValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and a "},{"code":".depositValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on each, declares the trophy case,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and names the rooms whose first entry pays. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" reads those traits and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"moves the number; the engine’s "},{"code":"score","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" verb, status line and end-of-game epilogue"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"do all the reporting."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" value is paid once per treasure and never taken back — dropping a gem"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"down a well does not refund it. "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Deposit"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" value follows the original Zork’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-case accounting: credited when the treasure lands in the trophy case, debited"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when it comes back out, so the displayed score rises and falls as the hoard is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rearranged. "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" on a register missing from the table is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"fatalError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than a silent zero, because a typo that pays nothing puts the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game quietly past its own maximum and nothing else would catch it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Wiring","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Wiring"},{"code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoScoring","","struct Hoard: Game {","    let title = \"Hoard\"","    let maxScore = 38","","    let scoring = Scoring(awards: [\"cellar\": 25])","","    let cellar = Location { name(\"Cellar\"); description(\"A low, dirt-floored cellar.\") }","    let idol = Item {","        name(\"jade idol\")","        trait(.takeValue, 5)","        trait(.depositValue, 8)","    }","    let trophyCase = Item { name(\"trophy case\"); container; openable; transparent }","","    var content: GameContents { scoring }","","    var rules: Rules {","        scoring.treasures([idol], into: trophyCase)","        scoring.visit(cellar, register: \"cellar\")","    }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"25 for the cellar, 5 for taking the idol, 8 for casing it: 38, which is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"maxScore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" says. Change any one of the three and the bootstrap says so."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An award that fires from somewhere other than a room entry calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" from inside any rule body, and reads its points from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same table:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["beacon.after(.turnOn) {","    scoring.awardOnce(\"beacon\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is the other direction, and is deliberately not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registered — a death toll is charged every time. The score is a plain "},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no floor, so it can go negative, as it does in the original after an early death."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Treasure values are not listed in the award table. They are already declared on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the items, and "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" sums them off the world. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game with an empty table and no valued treasures declares nothing and opts out of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the check."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Worked-examples","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Worked examples"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Sources\/Lighthouse\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the shortest: two event awards, one through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and one through "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Sources\/Zork1\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the full shape — five event awards plus nineteen treasures"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose take and deposit values total exactly the original’s 350."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoscoring"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Treasure and event scoring, over an award table the bootstrap can add up."}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"The content bundle","anchor":"The-content-bundle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/init(awards:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards"]},{"title":"Rules the host splices","anchor":"Rules-the-host-splices","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)"]},{"title":"Scoring from a rule body","anchor":"Scoring-from-a-rule-body","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)"]},{"title":"Declaring a treasure’s value","anchor":"Declaring-a-treasures-value","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/takeValue","doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/depositValue"]},{"title":"Checking the total","anchor":"Checking-the-total","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring":{"title":"Scoring","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scoring"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Treasure scoring: typed point values on items, a declared table of"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"award-once registers, and take\/deposit wiring for a trophy case. Add it to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"a game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"text":" block, name every award it can pay, put values on the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"treasures, and splice one factory call into the rules:"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scoring"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring":{"role":"collection","title":"GnustoScoring","abstract":[{"text":"Treasure and event scoring, over an award table the bootstrap can add up.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/awardOnce(_:)":{"title":"awardOnce(_:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/awardonce(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"awardOnce"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Awards a register’s declared points exactly once; later calls with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same name are silent no-ops, as is a zero-point award. Callable from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any rule body:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/treasures(_:into:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"treasures(_:into:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"For each treasure: the first "},{"code":"take","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" pays its "},{"code":".takeValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (once, for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"good), and its "},{"code":".depositValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" follows the trophy case — credited when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the treasure lands inside, debited when it is taken back out, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"original’s in-case accounting. Register keys derive from the item’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"display name (“take.green gem”), so treasures wired here need unique"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names. Splice into the host’s rules:"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"treasures"},{"kind":"text","text":"(["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Item","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Item","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Rules","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/treasures(_:into:)","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Gnusto/TraitKey/depositValue":{"title":"depositValue","type":"topic","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/gnusto\/traitkey\/depositvalue","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"depositValue"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TraitKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Points awarded the first time this treasure lands in the trophy case."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/depositValue"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/init(awards:)":{"title":"init(awards:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/init(awards:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"awards"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates the scoring content."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/init(awards:)"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/awards":{"title":"awards","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/awards","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"awards"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every award-once register this game can pay, and what each pays. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single source of truth: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awardOnce(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read their points from here rather than carrying them at the call site,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the total the bootstrap checks is the total the game pays."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/penalize(_:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"penalize(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deducts "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"points"},{"type":"text","text":" from the score — the flip side of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"awardOnce"},{"type":"text","text":", for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"penalties that aren’t award-once (a death toll charged every time)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Unlike an award, this is not registered and can repeat."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"penalize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/penalize(_:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/penalize(_:)","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/visit(_:register:)":{"title":"visit(_:register:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/visit(_:register:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"visit"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Location","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"register"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Rule","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4RuleV"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"onEnter","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule that pays "},{"code":"register","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s declared points the first time"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player enters "},{"code":"room","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", through "},{"code":"awardOnce","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — the event-scoring idiom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(Zork’s “into the cellar, +25”). Splice into the host’s rules:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/visit(_:register:)"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Gnusto/TraitKey/takeValue":{"title":"takeValue","type":"topic","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/gnusto\/traitkey\/takevalue","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"takeValue"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TraitKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Points awarded the first time this treasure is taken."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/takeValue"},"doc://GnustoScoring/documentation/GnustoScoring/Scoring/declaredMaxScore(items:)":{"role":"symbol","title":"declaredMaxScore(items:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything this plugin can pay over a complete playthrough: the declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/awards","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" table, plus every treasure’s "},{"code":".takeValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":".depositValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The bootstrap compares the total against the game’s "},{"code":"maxScore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"declaredMaxScore"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"items"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Item","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoScoring\/documentation\/GnustoScoring\/Scoring\/declaredMaxScore(items:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoscoring\/scoring\/declaredmaxscore(items:)"}}}